opencl-headers provides the OpenCL C and C++ headers without a loader library.

For the C headers:

    find_package(OpenCLHeaders CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE OpenCL::Headers)

For the C++ bindings:

    find_package(OpenCLHeadersCpp CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE OpenCL::HeadersCpp)

The headers default to OpenCL 3.1. To target the OpenCL 3.0 API explicitly:

    target_compile_definitions(main PRIVATE
        CL_TARGET_OPENCL_VERSION=300
        CL_HPP_TARGET_OPENCL_VERSION=300)

Install opencl and link OpenCL::OpenCL when calling the OpenCL API.
